{"id":1020804,"chapter_id":1020804,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"在风暴中颠簸了一夜，终于到达管理局时，你的伤口已经严重感染了。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"【转场】手术室，也许CH1的仰视天花板，加狂厄特效红色呼吸等","style":18,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"护士","content":"发烧、感染、还有狂厄污染！！怎么会拖成这样？？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"护士","content":"明明都被戾刃武器创伤了，还不做急救处理？你们怎么搞的，残锋团那些家伙也——","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"尤金","content":"抱歉，我被残锋团拦下了，没及时到局长身边。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"尤金","content":"不……要是我们能早点追回茉莉……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"options":["不是他们的错"],"style":6,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804007,"trial_step":7,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"不是他们的错","goto":8}]},{"step":8,"speaker":"%u","content":"我的疏忽……给残……涅槃港那边添了麻烦。他们有提供治疗方案，是我坚持……想早点回来……","style":2,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"再待在那里，茉莉的精神状态更难保障。必须尽快带她离开涅槃港，远离刺激。","style":3,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"%u","content":"没事……他们帮我处理过，而且我……狂厄抗性高，撑得住。只是……","style":2,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"意识有些模糊，说出去的话离得好远。","style":3,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"%u","content":"<size=36>帮</size><size=35>…</size><size=34>帮</size><size=33>忙</size><size=32>看</size><size=31>看</size><size=30>茉</size><size=29>莉</size><size=28>的</size><size=27>情</size><size=26>况</size><size=25>，</size><size=24>她</size><size=23>…</size><size=22>…</size><size=21>麻</size><size=20>烦</size><size=19>你</size><size=18>…</size><size=17>…</size>","style":2,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"护士","content":"不用您说我们也会做的！局长先管好自己，别再说话了，手术马上进行，先注射——","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1027,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"别过来！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"content":"茉莉猛地挥开护士的手，她对靠近你的尖锐针筒剧烈应激，母豹般弓背护住你的病床，浑然不觉自己惊惧脆弱的模样。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804016,"trial_step":16},{"step":16,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"他去了那种地方才受伤，又是那些戾刃干的，是狄斯人的刀伤了他……没一个好人，没人能信任……不管我得到什么都会被你们夺走……","female_content":"她去了那种地方才受伤，又是那些戾刃干的，是狄斯人的刀伤了她……没一个好人，没人能信任……不管我得到什么都会被你们夺走……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_23","vo_trial_20804_1_23f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804017,"trial_step":17},{"step":17,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"别过来！！别碰他！！","female_content":"别过来！！别碰她！！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_24","vo_trial_20804_1_24f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"speaker":"护士","content":"你在说什么呢？！局长必须接受手术，体温都41度了，你想看他被截肢吗？","female_content":"你在说什么呢？！局长必须接受手术，体温都41度了，你想看她被截肢吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_25","vo_trial_20804_1_25f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804019,"trial_step":19},{"step":19,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"！！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804020,"trial_step":20},{"step":20,"content":"这话惊得她浑身一震，脸上血色全无，发不出声又不肯退后。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804021,"trial_step":21},{"step":21,"speaker":"%u","content":"茉莉……","style":2,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804022,"trial_step":22},{"step":22,"content":"你呜咽出一点气音，她听见了。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"大人！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"content":"她一瞬间又回过神，贴紧了抓住你的手，再顾不得其他人。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"还难受吗？那我抱抱你，把身上的火烧给我就不烫了。这样好点吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804026,"trial_step":26},{"step":26,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我在，茉莉一直在，不会让那些坏家伙再靠近你一步，不会再让你受伤了。你脸色好差……我的血都给你好不好？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"content":"茉莉的身影渐渐晃作一团，那双眼睛盈满眼泪焦急地看着你，眼底已经容不下仇恨，全是巨大的恐惧和悲伤，她不敢离开，生怕一眨眼就又会失去。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"content":"透过你，她在看着谁？看着多少撕心裂肺离开她的人们？","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"呜呜……你说说话呀，告诉茉莉怎么做？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804030,"trial_step":30},{"step":30,"content":"你好想回应。可高烧，疼痛，你的身体和思维渐渐分离，视野变暗，你看不清了。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804031,"trial_step":31},{"step":31,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……不要闭眼睛、求求你，不要闭眼睛……大人！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804032,"trial_step":32},{"step":32,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"滚开！我叫你们别过来！唔——","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804033,"trial_step":33},{"step":33,"content":"茉莉被谁拽住，掰过身子，她要发火，却先一步被对面更严厉地喝住。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804034,"trial_step":34},{"step":34,"speaker":"小文","content":"够了茉莉！这样上下乱挠能治什么病，局长都快吐白泡了！摸摸这个，比你手冰吧？想他醒来就用退热贴，不让我们碰你就自己来！","female_content":"够了茉莉！这样上下乱挠能治什么病，局长都快吐白泡了！摸摸这个，比你手冰吧？想她醒来就用退热贴，不让我们碰你就自己来！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_42","vo_trial_20804_1_42f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804035,"trial_step":35},{"step":35,"content":"一叠冰一样的东西“啪”摔到茉莉手心，她打了个激灵，视野清晰了些——是张认识的脸，跟${PlayerName}一块儿的人。她紧紧抓住茉莉双肩，抓牢了支撑住。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804036,"trial_step":36},{"step":36,"speaker":"小文","content":"我知道茉莉听得懂，又不是真的猫，你聪明得很呢，那就好好听我说！局长这伤放哪个砂盗身上都活不了，他比砂盗还虚，就靠你那点野外急救根本没用。","female_content":"我知道茉莉听得懂，又不是真的猫，你聪明得很呢，那就好好听我说！局长这伤放哪个砂盗身上都活不了，她比砂盗还虚，就靠你那点野外急救根本没用。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_43","vo_trial_20804_1_43f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804037,"trial_step":37},{"step":37,"speaker":"小文","content":"他得做手术，手术，懂吗？要好几个人一起上，要真正厉害的专家来，要抓紧时间！你也得帮忙，快点！","female_content":"她得做手术，手术，懂吗？要好几个人一起上，要真正厉害的专家来，要抓紧时间！你也得帮忙，快点！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_44","vo_trial_20804_1_44f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804038,"trial_step":38},{"step":38,"speaker":"小文","content":"不只你一个人在乎局长，他对大家都很重要，再拖下去人真会死的。要是<color=#fb9259>他死了</color>，我<size=45>绝对</size><size=50>绝对</size>不会原谅你！","female_content":"不只你一个人在乎局长，她对大家都很重要，再拖下去人真会死的。要是<color=#fb9259>她死了</color>，我<size=45>绝对</size><size=50>绝对</size>不会原谅你！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_45","vo_trial_20804_1_45f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804039,"trial_step":39},{"step":39,"content":"这话像惊雷一般，茉莉呆愣在原地。好久，她干干地说。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804040,"trial_step":40},{"step":40,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……他要死了吗……再回不来了？连他也……","female_content":"……她要死了吗……再回不来了？连她也……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_48","vo_trial_20804_1_48f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804042,"trial_step":42},{"step":41,"content":"她看看小文，看看你，身子突然脱了力。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804043,"trial_step":43},{"step":42,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"呜……不要……不要……我的刀，我的刀呢，说话啊……救救大人，救救他……","female_content":"呜……不要……不要……我的刀，我的刀呢，说话啊……救救大人，救救她……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_49","vo_trial_20804_1_49f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804044,"trial_step":44},{"step":43,"content":"呜咽着，伸手摸索着，冰袋掉到地上，她两手空空什么都抓不住，只能蜷缩着捂住眼睛，不敢看你，不敢靠近你，一步步想挪进阴影中。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804045,"trial_step":45},{"step":44,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"都是茉莉的错……要怎么做才好，刀不在，我不知道啊……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804046,"trial_step":46},{"step":45,"content":"小文也有点慌了，赶紧拉过她的手，又张开手把她拥进怀里。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804047,"trial_step":47},{"step":46,"speaker":"小文","content":"一把刀能救什么人啊，我教你。一会儿医生负责手术，茉莉负责握紧局长的手，给他力量帮他克服难关。","female_content":"一把刀能救什么人啊，我教你。一会儿医生负责手术，茉莉负责握紧局长的手，给她力量帮她克服难关。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_52","vo_trial_20804_1_52f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804048,"trial_step":48},{"step":47,"speaker":"小文","content":"就……其实也没那么糟糕啦，医生们都很厉害，局长体质说不定也许可能大概有进步，更重要的是，你的心意就是最大的奇迹。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804049,"trial_step":49},{"step":48,"speaker":"尤金","content":"……那都是电视剧乱编的，手术得是无菌环境。哎！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804050,"trial_step":50},{"step":49,"content":"他小腿挨了小文一脚。护士也回来了，气呼呼接上了话。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804051,"trial_step":51},{"step":50,"speaker":"护士","content":"主治医生刚刚打了电话，他很快过来，还说如果茉莉希望，留下来反而更好，是机会。做好消毒就行。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804052,"trial_step":52},{"step":51,"speaker":"护士","content":"只是一会儿做起手术，${PlayerName}可能还会出血，说不定还有紧急情况。我们能处理，但场面难免刺激，你能做到冷静吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804053,"trial_step":53},{"step":52,"speaker":"护士","content":"到那时，再有什么激动的行为，那就真会伤害${PlayerName}了。你能控制好吗？有信心做到吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804054,"trial_step":54},{"step":53,"content":"她看向茉莉，再不计较刚刚的争执，只认真严肃地看着茉莉的眼睛，这是在等待一个“人”负责任的回答。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804055,"trial_step":55},{"step":54,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我——","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804056,"trial_step":56},{"step":55,"content":"【黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804057,"trial_step":57},{"step":56,"speaker":"护士","content":"血压，心跳,……除颤仪准备，按压器，准备气管插管……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804058,"trial_step":58},{"step":57,"speaker":"护士","content":"情况还稳定吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804059,"trial_step":59},{"step":58,"content":"【黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804060,"trial_step":60},{"step":59,"content":"茉莉没有留下。她自己选择离开手术室，没走远，在外面蹲在门口，后背紧紧贴着门缝。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804061,"trial_step":61},{"step":60,"content":"小文拥着她的肩，轻声安抚。尤金在一旁看护，通信联系来回送物资，给茉莉水、毛毯、镇定药物。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804062,"trial_step":62},{"step":61,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……………………","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804063,"trial_step":63},{"step":62,"speaker":"小文","content":"没事的，没事的，更坏的手术都做过，他没事的……","female_content":"没事的，没事的，更坏的手术都做过，她没事的……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_66","vo_trial_20804_1_66f"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804064,"trial_step":64},{"step":63,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"对不起……对不起……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804065,"trial_step":65},{"step":64,"content":"戾刃不在了，她的手再抓不住刀，这次，换他人握住她冰凉的手，用力，攥紧了。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804066,"trial_step":66},{"step":65,"content":"（手术音：滴————","style":18,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804067,"trial_step":67},{"step":66,"content":"【黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804068,"trial_step":68},{"step":67,"content":"归还戾刃后\n第3天","style":9,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804069,"trial_step":69},{"step":68,"content":"你醒了。手术结束，没有意外，理所当然地成功，你还久违地做了几个安稳好梦。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804071,"trial_step":71},{"step":69,"content":"探视的人很多。从FAC的老家伙，到管理局里年幼的禁闭者，甚至有朋友带来了他们的宠物，总之形形色色的来访者都让你们见了个遍。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804072,"trial_step":72},{"step":70,"content":"其实有点累，但想到这些都是纯粹的善意，你都应承下来。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804073,"trial_step":73},{"step":71,"content":"你希望茉莉看到这些，也能感到些许温暖。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804074,"trial_step":74},{"step":72,"speaker":"医生","content":"我们还是尽量不给她刺激。您不在时，茉莉有小文她们陪着，她已经能跟几个人交流、还能表现出需求……她在尝试恢复社会性，这比之前好太多太多。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804075,"trial_step":75},{"step":73,"speaker":"医生","content":"她主动提出希望接受更多“治疗”方案，想快点好起来……不管怎么说，她都在试图寻找复仇之外的办法来平息痛苦，也不再拒绝他人了。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804076,"trial_step":76},{"step":74,"speaker":"医生","content":"局长，您做到了，很了不起。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804077,"trial_step":77},{"step":75,"content":"……做到了吗？","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804078,"trial_step":78},{"step":76,"content":"回过头，你看到茉莉蜷缩在沙发的一角，缩成小小的一团，直到对上你的眼睛。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804079,"trial_step":79},{"step":77,"content":"四目相对间，你还没开口，她就站起身，顺从地向你走来。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804080,"trial_step":80},{"step":78,"content":"【黑屏转场】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804081,"trial_step":81},{"step":79,"content":"归还戾刃后\n1周","style":9,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804082,"trial_step":82},{"step":80,"content":"你们的约定在一个个兑现。在新城公园晒太阳，去小巷深处尝尝美食，远远看看异邦定居的街道是怎样的风貌。她说很高兴，但每次都离得有些远，也许还不能适应人群。","style":3,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804083,"trial_step":83},{"step":81,"content":"小文每次逛街回来都要给茉莉带衣服饰品，说放下刀了茉莉就该漂漂亮亮。茉莉只挑了件舒适的真丝家居衫，穿上，蹭蹭，笑着说自己很喜欢。她知道怎么让小文更开心。","style":3,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804084,"trial_step":84},{"step":82,"content":"大多数时候在你办公室，你工作，茉莉在边上陪着。她再不讨好捣乱了，对所有人都友善礼貌，不再会乱推桌面上的水杯，也不偷看你的终端或文件。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804085,"trial_step":85},{"step":83,"content":"她半夜还会惊醒，会做噩梦，但被你唤醒后不再挣扎逃跑。她努力留在你看得见的地方，努力平息自己，第二天，主动找医生治疗。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804086,"trial_step":86},{"step":84,"content":"她对你说得最多的话是：","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804087,"trial_step":87},{"step":85,"content":"……嗯，我听您的。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804088,"trial_step":88},{"step":86,"content":"仇恨自毁好像突然被谁抹杀了，你却很难感到欣慰。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804089,"trial_step":89},{"step":87,"content":"你知道创伤还远未愈合。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804090,"trial_step":90},{"step":88,"content":"归还戾刃后\n两个月","style":9,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804091,"trial_step":91},{"step":89,"content":"【管理局，警报声，人群惊呼声】","style":18,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804092,"trial_step":92},{"step":90,"content":"警报突然作响，人们在走廊四处奔走，在找什么人。你出门拦下护士。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804093,"trial_step":93},{"step":91,"options":["发生什么事了？"],"style":6,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804094,"trial_step":94,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"发生什么事了？","goto":95}]},{"step":92,"speaker":"护士","content":"我也不清楚，茉莉说想跟其他禁闭者待待，我就带她去了。本来玩得好好的……有说有笑。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804095,"trial_step":95},{"step":93,"speaker":"护士","content":"结果艾米潘一高兴，说要办个欢迎会，搞个庆祝活动，还让茉莉跳舞……突然就这样了。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804096,"trial_step":96},{"step":94,"speaker":"%u","content":"…………是“庆典”。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804097,"trial_step":97},{"step":95,"content":"你立刻赶了出去。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804098,"trial_step":98},{"step":96,"content":"在一片混乱中，你顺着枷锁，独自来到一个无人的仓库。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804099,"trial_step":99},{"step":97,"options":["茉莉，你在吧？"],"style":6,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804100,"trial_step":100,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"茉莉，你在吧？","goto":101}]},{"step":98,"content":"黑暗中没有回答，你知道她在，但突然开灯可能会刺激她，你决定换个方式。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804101,"trial_step":101},{"step":99,"speaker":"%u","content":"奇怪，枷锁指的是这儿啊，怎么没见人呢……在高处吗？不伸手够不着架子啊，试试……","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804102,"trial_step":102},{"step":100,"speaker":"%u","content":"哎哟——痛痛痛……","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804103,"trial_step":103},{"step":101,"content":"一个身影蹭——地窜到你身边，抓住你的手就要看你的旧伤。结果被你反手逮住。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804104,"trial_step":104},{"step":102,"speaker":"%u","content":"抓到你了。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804105,"trial_step":105},{"step":103,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"…………","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804106,"trial_step":106},{"step":104,"content":"她抖了一下，却连挣扎逃走的勇气都没有，乖乖被你抓着，身子又缩了一圈。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804107,"trial_step":107},{"step":105,"content":"你摸到她手心的冷汗，心一堵，当即后悔起来。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804108,"trial_step":108},{"step":106,"speaker":"%u","content":"……对不起，我只想开个玩笑，吓到你了。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804109,"trial_step":109},{"step":107,"speaker":"%u","content":"我很好，被你照顾得特别好，只是有些担心。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804110,"trial_step":110},{"step":108,"speaker":"%u","content":"茉莉你还好吗？刚刚在外面……","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804111,"trial_step":111},{"step":109,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我没事……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804112,"trial_step":112},{"step":110,"content":"停了会儿，她又说。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804113,"trial_step":113},{"step":111,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"对不起……茉莉又给您添麻烦了，她们说有庆典……我……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804114,"trial_step":114},{"step":112,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"不，跟庆典也没关系，茉莉会努力的，以后会好好克服，好好往前走的……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804115,"trial_step":115},{"step":113,"content":"她的头埋得更低，手不受控制地抓着皮肤，廊灯隐约照出一道道或新或旧的伤痕，她抓得很用力，像在自罚，又像在克制。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804116,"trial_step":116},{"step":114,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"带我去见医生吧……冻起来也可以，再不醒来也可以……茉莉不想再惹事了，不想再这样下去了……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804117,"trial_step":117},{"step":115,"content":"你说不出话来，牵过她的手攥在手心，好一阵，才艰难开口。","style":18,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804118,"trial_step":118},{"step":116,"options":["……别这样勉强自己"],"style":6,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804119,"trial_step":119,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……别这样勉强自己","goto":122}]},{"step":117,"content":"你知道的，给她的所有都不够治愈过往，她只是回想起失去的恐惧。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804120,"trial_step":120},{"step":118,"content":"是恐惧盖过一切，迫使她放下仇恨，又促使她反向压抑伤害自己。你只是挖出她被埋得更深的创伤。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804121,"trial_step":121},{"step":119,"speaker":"%u","content":"我这只是小伤，不会死，更不是茉莉的错。是我考虑不周，我不该让你再看到这样的场面。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804122,"trial_step":122},{"step":120,"content":"你想告诉她，你后悔了。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804123,"trial_step":123},{"step":121,"content":"痛苦是那么庞大，它咆哮着要宣泄，却又找不到出口。那与其让她这样向内伤害自己，你宁愿她把矛头指向外，恨这个残酷的世界，或者恨你。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804124,"trial_step":124},{"step":122,"speaker":"%u","content":"生气的话就来骂我好了，揍我也可以。骗我耍我利用我都没问题，把愤怒都朝我扔来吧，我都会接住的。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804125,"trial_step":125},{"step":123,"speaker":"%u","content":"……我会陪着你的。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804126,"trial_step":126},{"step":124,"content":"她怔怔看着你，封锁的心终于又有了裂痕，却只流露出更多的困惑、不安和彷徨。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804127,"trial_step":127},{"step":125,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……你才是……为什么对我这么好？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804128,"trial_step":128},{"step":126,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"随我去就好了，别管我就好了，为什么抓着我不放？那天要不是你跟来，我才不会——","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804129,"trial_step":129},{"step":127,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"明明就算我死也跟你没关系啊……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804130,"trial_step":130},{"step":128,"content":"你记得，就在几个月前的审查室，那时候你们之间的关系还有些剑拔弩张，她也问过你相似的问题。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804131,"trial_step":131},{"step":129,"content":"……对啊，为什么？从什么时候开始？","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804132,"trial_step":132},{"step":130,"content":"你看着茉莉，眼前恍惚掠过那些噩梦。恐惧、愤怒、仇恨、癫狂、无可奈何的失去，无能为力的痛苦……","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804133,"trial_step":133},{"step":131,"speaker":"%u","content":"……我们是一样的……","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804134,"trial_step":134},{"step":132,"content":"【闪过海拉受苦战争CG】","style":18,"background":4606,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804136,"trial_step":136},{"step":133,"content":"被掩埋多少次，只要看见茉莉，它们都会再浮现眼前，织成噩梦，提醒你战争真实碾过，这一页不可能被遗忘。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804138,"trial_step":138},{"step":134,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"你骗人……你明明是狄斯人……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804139,"trial_step":139},{"step":135,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"明明是狄斯人……我们……也能是一样的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804140,"trial_step":140},{"step":136,"speaker":"%u","content":"你是对的，是我太狂妄，抱歉。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804141,"trial_step":141},{"step":137,"content":"说着，你轻轻抱住她。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804142,"trial_step":142},{"step":138,"speaker":"%u","content":"虽然不一样，但我也有受不了的痛苦，只靠自己治不好全部创伤。所以我希望你能好。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804143,"trial_step":143},{"step":139,"speaker":"%u","content":"人会去治愈他人来治疗自己，陪别人往前走的同时，自己也能向前进。就像现在……","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804144,"trial_step":144},{"step":140,"speaker":"%u","content":"像这样拥抱痛苦的你，我感觉自己也被人拥抱。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":100000145,"trial_step":145},{"step":141,"content":"你看不到她的表情，过了很久，她小声地问。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804146,"trial_step":146},{"step":142,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"……能治好吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_141"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804147,"trial_step":147},{"step":143,"speaker":"%u","content":"我不知道，茉莉，我不知道……","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804148,"trial_step":148},{"step":144,"speaker":"%u","content":"但如果你太痛了，一个人承受不了了……那就分给我吧……","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804149,"trial_step":149},{"step":145,"speaker":"%u","content":"只要你活着，只要还愿意活着。哪怕前路一片荒芜，也会有人陪你一起，等花再开……","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804150,"trial_step":150},{"step":146,"content":"她听懂了吗？你不知道。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804151,"trial_step":151},{"step":147,"content":"只感觉一双手颤抖着攀上你的肩，然后。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804152,"trial_step":152},{"step":148,"content":"……紧紧抱住。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804153,"trial_step":153},{"step":149,"content":"【黑屏转场】","style":18,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804154,"trial_step":154},{"step":150,"content":"归还戾刃后\n很久","style":9,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804155,"trial_step":155},{"step":151,"content":"又发生过很多事，有好事，有坏事。茉莉早已习惯待在她的独立房间，有小文给她买的娃娃，还养了只小猫，现在，她不再依赖你每天夜里的陪护。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804156,"trial_step":156},{"step":152,"content":"所以，这晚，当她穿戴整齐，来到你床前等你睁眼时，你感到有些意外。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804157,"trial_step":157},{"step":153,"content":"确认不是梦后，你牵过她的手。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804158,"trial_step":158},{"step":154,"options":["做噩梦了吗？没事吧？"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804159,"trial_step":159,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"做噩梦了吗？没事吧？","goto":160}]},{"step":155,"content":"她的手不算冰，只是人怔怔的，好久，才说话。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804160,"trial_step":160},{"step":156,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"我……做了个梦。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_149"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804161,"trial_step":161},{"step":157,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"梦到自己上台，要跳不一样的舞。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_150"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804162,"trial_step":162},{"step":158,"content":"她眼神很空，说话很慢，很慢。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804163,"trial_step":163},{"step":159,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"不用拿刀，也没有火炮……我去了另一场庆典，有些熟悉，又很陌生，好多人在看我……亲人，客人，陌生人……您也在台下，和那些狄斯人一起，等我跳舞……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_152"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804164,"trial_step":164},{"step":160,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"可已经过去太久了，我都忘了不拿刀要怎么跳了……就这么上台，只会被大家笑话……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_153"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804165,"trial_step":165},{"step":161,"content":"停了好久，茉莉抬起眼，看向你，有些畏缩。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804166,"trial_step":166},{"step":162,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"您可以帮我看看吗，就当是……练习？","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_155"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804167,"trial_step":167},{"step":163,"speaker":"%u","content":"…………","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804168,"trial_step":168},{"step":164,"options":["当然，我很愿意"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804169,"trial_step":169,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"当然，我很愿意","goto":170}]},{"step":165,"content":"茉莉看着你，缓缓后退至房间中央。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804170,"trial_step":170},{"step":166,"content":"夜灯苍白，权当作月光斜照，也算是照亮你们的篝火。她的手向上舒展，好像那便是天空，柔软的身体恍若溪流，在月色下波光流淌。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804171,"trial_step":171},{"step":167,"content":"没有刀，没流血，观众只有一个人。舞者闭上眼，伴着无声的节拍，在破碎的记忆中寻觅拼凑着遗失的舞步。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804172,"trial_step":172},{"step":168,"content":"终于穿过风沙，穿行千里，抵达被掩埋的时间的尽头。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804173,"trial_step":173},{"step":169,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"<i>火焰去点燃烛台，迎接破土的新苗。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_166"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2400,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804174,"trial_step":174},{"step":170,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"<i>利箭去射穿花靶，聆听外婆的祝祷。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_167"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2400,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804175,"trial_step":175},{"step":171,"content":"【切场景】","style":18,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804176,"trial_step":176},{"step":172,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……局长，给您的密信，远邦来的。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_170"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804178,"trial_step":178},{"step":173,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"是机构内信函，很安全。但……没错，没有署名。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_172"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804179,"trial_step":179},{"step":174,"speaker":"%u","content":"…………","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804180,"trial_step":180},{"step":175,"content":"这不算密信，没有留言，寄信人似乎没有话想跟你说。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804181,"trial_step":181},{"step":176,"content":"又像是觉得你都能懂。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804182,"trial_step":182},{"step":177,"content":"你看着手里的“信”。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804183,"trial_step":183},{"step":178,"speaker":"%u","content":"……通知外事局和第九机关，不用再找了。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804184,"trial_step":184},{"step":179,"speaker":"%u","content":"我知道地方在哪儿，找机会去一趟吧……","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804185,"trial_step":185},{"step":180,"content":"【狄斯城夜景】","style":18,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804186,"trial_step":186},{"step":181,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"<i>花车田间巡游，游进安睡的美梦。烟花夜空绽放，照亮新修的屋房。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_168"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804187,"trial_step":187},{"step":182,"content":"【切场景，涅槃刚】","style":18,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804189,"trial_step":189},{"step":183,"content":"狄斯上将又一次远行归来，把城里发来的新战争提案随手扔进垃圾桶，回到涅槃港外的墓地。","style":3,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804190,"trial_step":190},{"step":184,"content":"墓地里零零散散立了几十块新碑，有的是她这次外出收敛的枯骨，有的则是最近那次冲突事件中添出的新坟。","style":3,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804191,"trial_step":191},{"step":185,"content":"她找到刻着阿尔钦名字的那个，并排几个也是那会儿一起犯浑的傻子。终究没能救回来，说不定他们对这结局还挺满意。","style":3,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804192,"trial_step":192},{"step":186,"content":"将军看了很久，上前，在每个坟头上都狠踹了一脚。","style":3,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804193,"trial_step":193},{"step":187,"content":"然后她俯下身，在阿尔钦的墓前留下迟来的几张照片。","style":3,"background":2453,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804194,"trial_step":194},{"step":188,"content":"【异邦郊外】加个照片/印刷品滤镜","style":18,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804195,"trial_step":195},{"step":189,"content":"照片里，穿过风沙，穿行千里，在被时间掩埋的尽头，是一片谷地，被人遗忘的战场。","style":3,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804196,"trial_step":196},{"step":190,"content":"当年的痕迹都被磨平，房屋、田地、弹坑、枯骨……失落的村庄只留些许残垣断壁，无人为它立碑，也许拍照的人觉得太虚伪。","style":3,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804197,"trial_step":197},{"step":191,"content":"她只把一对几近碎裂的刀送了过去，立于碎石间，在整片废墟视野最好的地方。倘若过去有庆典，这里一定便是舞台中央。","style":3,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804198,"trial_step":198},{"step":192,"content":"那对刀就立在舞台中央，然后……","style":3,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804199,"trial_step":199},{"step":193,"content":"【背景延续，去掉书籍滤镜，换成有些梦幻轻微幻觉的滤镜","style":18,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804200,"trial_step":200},{"step":194,"content":"绿芽钻出尘土，顺着刀身裂痕向上，向上。新生的花芽即将绽放，它恍惚听见台下雀跃的欢呼。","style":3,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804201,"trial_step":201},{"step":195,"speaker":"同乡A","content":"茉莉……茉莉…………","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_160"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804202,"trial_step":202},{"step":196,"speaker":"同乡B","content":"庆典来了，丰收到了，当年的客人又回来了……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_161"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804203,"trial_step":203},{"step":197,"speaker":"同乡B","content":"他们记得庆典，记得茉莉的舞步……他们还带了礼物，说一直想着要回礼呢。","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_162"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804204,"trial_step":204},{"step":198,"speaker":"同乡C","content":"有礼物？那就是朋友咯！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_163"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804205,"trial_step":205},{"step":199,"content":"花开了，绿叶溢满舞台，掩埋破碎的戾刃，洗去满目疮痍。也许战火从未点燃，阳光又破开沙暴，一张张面孔穿过天灾加入庆典。","style":3,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804206,"trial_step":206},{"step":200,"content":"人们擦掉脸上的血，扔掉手里的刀，大笑着相拥，畅饮，共舞，用家乡话、狄斯语大声高喊：","style":3,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804207,"trial_step":207},{"step":201,"speaker":"同乡C","content":"来吧茉莉！庆典要开始了！","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_164"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2006,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804208,"trial_step":208},{"step":202,"content":"【办公室","style":18,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804210,"trial_step":210},{"step":203,"content":"舞戛然而止。舞者没有微笑谢幕，她像断了线的人偶，空洞地站在他乡异客灰暗的房间。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804211,"trial_step":211},{"step":204,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"结束了……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_185"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804212,"trial_step":212},{"step":205,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"庆典一完，原来真的什么都不剩……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_186"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804213,"trial_step":213},{"step":206,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"什么都不剩了啊，大人……什么都回不来了……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_187"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804214,"trial_step":214},{"step":207,"content":"你无言地上前，将她拥入怀中。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804215,"trial_step":215},{"step":208,"options":["还有你在，茉莉"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804216,"trial_step":216,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"还有你在，茉莉","goto":217}]},{"step":209,"speaker":"%u","content":"很棒的庆典，我不会忘的。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804217,"trial_step":217},{"step":210,"speaker":"%u","content":"我们都不会忘的……","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804218,"trial_step":218},{"step":211,"content":"慢慢的，你胸口湿润了，耳边传来啜泣，到最后，放声大哭。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804219,"trial_step":219},{"step":212,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"呜呜……呜啊啊啊啊……","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_193"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804220,"trial_step":220},{"step":213,"content":"穿过战场，穿过噩梦，被恨与惧千刀万剐后，停滞的庆典终于结束了。被剥夺了那么多，追讨了这么久，如今才仅仅走出第一步，找回第一件失去了很久的宝物。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804221,"trial_step":221},{"step":214,"content":"你抱着她，紧紧抱着她。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804222,"trial_step":222},{"step":215,"content":"失乡之人终于卸下破碎的笑容，找回自己的眼泪，拼凑起来的心找回了悲伤。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804223,"trial_step":223},{"step":216,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"<i>客人啊，若你来到他乡的庆典……</i>","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_197"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2482,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804225,"trial_step":225},{"step":217,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"<i>掸去尘土，举起酒杯，来赞美相逢，来共度良宵，尽兴而归前，再期盼来年。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_198"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2482,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804226,"trial_step":226},{"step":218,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"<i>来年……再来年，远方的朋友……愿我们再聚首。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_199"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2482,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804227,"trial_step":227},{"step":219,"speaker":"茉莉","content":"<i>下一场庆典，愿还能与你再见。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_20804_1_200"],"voice_bank":"vo_jasmine_trial","style":1,"background":2482,"log_type":1,"src_id":120804228,"trial_step":228}]}